{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1063868/block/singleImage/3267641/df/01M7F7N0SYYYK50V1MG1NRZJ6A.jpg?updatedAt=1794737522\"/><figcaption>瑅海單日沽6伙，最高呎價逾2.9萬。</figcaption></figure><p>信和置業(083)、招商局置地(978)及市區重建局 合作發展的紅磡新盤「瑅海」銷情持續，項目今日連錄6宗成交，當中5伙以招標形式售出。最高成交價及呎價單位為1座22樓A3室，實用面積668方呎，以1,962.25萬元成交，折合呎價高達29,375元。 另外，以價單形式售出的單位為2座12樓A2室，實用面積394方呎，成交價938.77萬元，呎價23,827元。項目開售至今反應熱烈，累計已售出340伙，合共套現逾30億元。 即睇紅磡瑅海最新資訊 (House730)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T10:39:29.640239+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":254,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T09:17:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T01:43:44.812194+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T10:33:05.125845+00:00","content_hash":"e637e22fc1f3cacfaeef515c448419d5be041415faae671d06d5a73ab069c0ef","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}